# Golden fixtures and sources are compared byte-exact in tests; CRLF checkout
# on Windows breaks them. Keep every text file LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.bin binary
*.crdt binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
